msgstr "MCP Abilities"

#: includes/Hooks/Admin/RegisterAbilitiesPage.php:72
msgid "Pick the abilities exposed to MCP clients. Destructive abilities are off until you enable them."
msgstr "Choisissez les abilities exposées aux clients MCP. Les abilities destructives sont désactivées tant que vous ne les activez pas."

